  "design_changes": [
    "Restores black section-title bands and black attribute-shield chiefs, preserving all writing capacities and field positions.",
    "Imports the same font tokens and original boundary marks as the main rulebook.",
    "Removes nested frames, grey label bands, redundant ancestry/background rules, the Party Leader checkbox, and boxed Carried Coins.",
    "Removes weapon/armour reminders and the complete advancement reference from the blank only.",
    "Merges equipped and carried possessions into one Inventory; Coins uses a compact line.",
    "Leaves the portrait/arms arch empty by default.",
    "Allocates full-width, two-line description areas for Powers and Talents, plus Hero Details."
  ],
